 "summary": "Metalanguage and tool for writing programming-language definitions in an ASCII notation close to informal mathematics: grammars with binding specifications and inductively defined relations, from which Ott generates LaTeX, Coq, HOL4, Isabelle/HOL and OCaml definitions (with substitution and free-variable functions).",
